OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed as fire crews tackle
OL,4,Ablaze in Petworth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road has been closed in West Sussex
OL,7,Fas firefighters tackle a blaze at a
OL,8,Fhouse.
OL,10,FThe fire broke out at the property in
OL,11,FEgdean shortly before 03:00 BST, and
OL,12,Fsix fire engines and an aerial ladder
OL,13,Fvehicle were deplyed.
OL,15,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,F(WSFRS) said the blaze had been brought
OL,17,Funder control by 09:00, but two fire
OL,18,Fengines and the aerial ladder vehicle
OL,19,Fremain at the scene.
OL,21,FThe A283 has been closed in both
OL,22,Fdirections.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
